<p>Pope Leo said Wednesday that the world needs a message of peace, dialogue, and coexistence, even as President Donald Trump kept criticizing him on social media, including for a second time that week according to some reports. Speaking to reporters on his flight from Algeria to Cameroon during the second leg of a 10-day Africa tour, Leo said his travels had reinforced the importance of respect across different beliefs and communities. Rather than escalate, the Pope kept the focus on reconciliation. He presented peace and unity as an answer to political and social division.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/dM-y7Rsein5P_djxj2cCAjpAMHkqi2BQDIC52YHf60pbRtefg4uHAzTXmi0jJuQNryZls1FojE7SK31BSEAqa13aAUgtDAXzFQinjri-IG8Ab6H9wEW8xkzjgDN1zhkRjEhpuU-h0w_FUQJN_lBTwOBJOCgNfK_EY9D4qAFqhS3sZvu_hla6rhUG3FL_gsv3QrM4BrGC5JjzBXgaLjgKf5Hnk7_Nu5JUfBSF-nozj9NVWHVBps_trQttD_MBY9Pbqg1JnnKLWEl4Gx964iW8_lVHDqjwsxbsNEHpYidqSCvk_wIxZwXzXuJfcZRabp2mTIeJeLzUs088IssIXBRandicaCItV7ZmpCFNNiUoyEF0zsGBJsgm4udj6_S50OWMWzy0n22W3v8r_xoblN7R-PCL3HLDnnYAADGqMtjqqCnwaL83M25cAXhZyLbXjaK6D91WGpiTd91D_dM1aGEtpWVVsLVaHAc8FJmmxoFh3ZTCDrO35gYngPQ' alt='Pope Leo XIV speaks during a flight on his Africa tour as he reiterates a message of peace.' /><br /><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://japantoday.com/category/world/pope-doubles-down-on-message-of-peace-and-unity-as-trump%27s-criticism-continues'>Pope doubles down on peace and unity message as Trump&#x27;s criticism continues</a> - japantoday.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/africa/article/3350217/pope-leo-stresses-message-peace-and-unity-despite-another-trump-attack'>Pope Leo stresses message of peace and unity despite another Trump attack</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1sm8vmt/pope_leo_attacked_again_by_trump_says_world_needs/'>Pope Leo, attacked again by Trump, says world needs message of peace</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/nation/pope-doubles-down-o